    "summary": "Wargear, 1 CP. Use it in any phase right after an enemy model that has the Deadly Demise ability, other than a TITANIC model, is destroyed. Target one HERETIC ASTARTES CHARACTER unit of yours that had that model within 18\" at the moment it was destroyed. The opposing player skips the roll that decides whether that Deadly Demise ability inflicts mortal wounds; the mortal wounds are inflicted automatically, though if the amount of mortal wounds is random, they still roll for it as usual.",
